ply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S011_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"向右拐。","meaning_my":"ညာဘက်ကွေ့ပါ။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S011_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S012","kind":"main","cn":"先下楼，再往右走。","meaning_my":"အရင် အောက်ဆင်းပြီး ညာဘက်ကို သွားပါ။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S013","kind":"main","cn":"在这边吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီဘက်မှာလား။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S014","kind":"main","cn":"楼上还是楼下？","meaning_my":"အပေါ်ထပ်လား၊ အောက်ထပ်လား။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S014_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"在楼上，三楼。","meaning_my":"အပေါ်ထပ်မှာ၊ တတိယထပ်ပါ။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S014_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S015","kind":"main","cn":"附近有便利店吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီနားမှာ စတိုးဆိုင် ရှိလား။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S015_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"有，前面就有一家。","meaning_my":"ရှိတယ်၊ ရှေ့နားမှာ တစ်ဆိုင်ရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S015_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S015_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"这附近有便利店吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီနားမှာ စတိုးဆိုင် ရှိလား။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S015_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S016","kind":"main","cn":"这附近没有，得走远一点。","meaning_my":"ဒီနားမှာ မရှိဘူး၊ နည်းနည်း ဝေးဝေးသွားရမယ်။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S017","kind":"main","cn":"离这里远吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီကနေ ဝေးလား။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S017_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"不远，走几分钟就到了。","meaning_my":"မဝေးဘူး၊ မိနစ်နည်းနည်း လျှောက်ရင် ရောက်ပြီ။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S017_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S017_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"远不远？","meaning_my":"ဝေးလား။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S017_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S018","kind":"main","cn":"有点远，最好坐车。","meaning_my":"နည်းနည်းဝေးတယ်၊ ကားစီးသွားတာ ပိုကောင်းမယ်။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S019","kind":"main","cn":"要上楼吗？","meaning_my":"အပေါ်တက်ရမလား။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S019_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"不用，上下楼都不用。","meaning_my":"မလိုဘူး၊ အပေါ်တက်စရာ အောက်ဆင်းစရာ မလိုဘူး။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S019_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S019_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"需要上楼吗？","meaning_my":"အပေါ်ထပ်ကို တက်ရမလား။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S019_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S020","kind":"main","cn":"我是不是走错了？","meaning_my":"လမ်းမှားသွားတာလား။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S020_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"对，得往回走。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်တယ်၊ ပြန်လှည့်သွားရမယ်။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S020_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S020_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我走错了吗？","meaning_my":"လမ်းမှားသွားပြီလား။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S020_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S021","kind":"main","cn":"从这边能过去吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီဘက်ကနေ ဖြတ်သွားလို့ရလား။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S021_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"这边能走吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီဘက်ကနေ သွားလို့ရလား။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S021_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S022","kind":"main","cn":"就在前面。","meaning_my":"ရှေ့နားမှာပဲ။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S022_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"前面就是。","meaning_my":"ရှေ့နားမှာပဲ။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S022_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S023","kind":"main","cn":"在二楼。","meaning_my":"ဒုတိယထပ်မှာ ရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S024","kind":"main","cn":"在马路对面。","meaning_my":"ကားလမ်းတစ်ဖက်ခြမ်းမှာ ရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S024_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"在路对面。","meaning_my":"လမ်းတစ်ဖက်ခြမ်းမှာပဲ။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S024_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S025","kind":"main","cn":"过了红绿灯右转。","meaning_my":"မီးပွိုင့်ကို ကျော်ပြီး ညာဘက်ကွေ့ပါ။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S026","kind":"main","cn":"很近，走路五分钟。","meaning_my":"နီးနီးလေးပါ၊ လမ်းလျှောက် ငါးမိနစ်လောက်ပဲ။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S026.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S026_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"不远，走五分钟就到。","meaning_my":"မဝေးဘူး၊ ငါးမိနစ် လျှောက်ရင် ရောက်ပြီ။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S026_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S027","kind":"main","cn":"你走反了。","meaning_my":"လမ်းပြောင်းပြန် သွားမိပြီ။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S027.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S028","kind":"main","cn":"我也不太清楚。","meaning_my":"ဒီဘက်လည်း သိပ်မသိဘူး။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S028.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S029","kind":"main","cn":"走过去要多久？","meaning_my":"လမ်းလျှောက်သွားရင် ဘယ်လောက်ကြာမလဲ။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S029.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S029_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"大概十分钟。","meaning_my":"ဆယ်မိနစ်လောက် ကြာမယ်။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S029_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.02-S029_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"步行要多久？","meaning_my":"လမ်းလျှောက်ရင် ဘယ်လောက်ကြာမလဲ။","audio_file":"01.04.02-S029_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.03-S001","kind":"main","cn":"这是谁的？","meaning_my":"ဒါ ဘယ်သူ့ဟာလဲ။","audio_file":"01.04.03-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.03-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"是我的。","meaning_my":"ကိုယ့်ဟာပါ။","audio_file":"01.04.03-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.03-S001_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"这东西是谁的？","meaning_my":"ဒီပစ္စည်း ဘယ်သူ့ဟာလဲ။","audio_file":"01.04.03-S001_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.03-S002","kind":"main","cn":"是你的吗？","meaning_my":"ဒါ ခင်ဗျားဟာလား။","audio_file":"01.04.03-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.03-S002_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"不是我的，是他的。","meaning_my":"ကိုယ့်ဟာ မဟုတ်ဘူး၊ သူ့ဟာပါ။","audio_file":"01.04.03-S002_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.03-S002_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"这是你的东西吗？","meaning_my":"ဒါ ခင်ဗျားပစ္စည်းလား။","audio_file":"01.04.03-S002_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.03-S003","kind":"main","cn":"这是我的。","meaning_my":"ဒါ ကိုယ့်ဟာပါ။","audio_file":"01.04.03-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.03-S004","kind":"main","cn":"这是他的。","meaning_my":"ဒါ သူ့ဟာပါ။","audio_file":"01.04.03-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.03-S005","kind":"main","cn":"这不是我的。","meaning_my":"ဒါ ကိုယ့်ဟာ မဟုတ်ဘူး။","audio_file":"01.04.03-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.03-S006","kind":"main","cn":"我该找谁？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်သူ့ဆီ သွားမေးရမလဲ။","audio_file":"01.04.03-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.03-S006_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"你找前台问一下。","meaning_my":"ဧည့်ကြိုကောင်တာမှာ သွားမေးကြည့်ပါ။","audio_file":"01.04.03-S006_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.03-S006_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"这事应该找谁？","meaning_my":"ဒီကိစ္စ ဘယ်သူ့ကို သွားမေးရမလဲ။","audio_file":"01.04.03-S006_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.03-S007","kind":"main","cn":"哪位是主管？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်သူက ကြီးကြပ်ရေးမှူးလဲ။","audio_file":"01.04.03-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.03-S007_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"穿蓝衣服的那位。","meaning_my":"အပြာရောင် အင်္ကျီဝတ်ထားတဲ့သူပါ။","audio_file":"01.04.03-S007_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.04.03-S007_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"主管是哪位？","meaning_my":"ကြီးကြပ်ရေးမှူး